    <panel_attributes>title=SD6 - Check conflicts, then fix one by chat (F06, F07 / UC06, UC07)
obj=Student~s ACTOR
obj=:MainWindow~w
obj=:MainController~c
obj=:PlannerFacade~f
obj=:ConflictChecker~cc
obj=:Agent~a
obj=llm:LlmClient~llm
obj=move_task:MoveTaskTool~mt
obj=:Plan~pl
obj=:Workspace~ws
s-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : click Check conflicts
w-&gt;&gt;&gt;c : onCheckConflicts()
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;f : checkConflicts()
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;cc : check(workspace, forecast)
cc.&gt;f : conflicts, e.g. Gym overlaps the Tuesday lab
f.&gt;c : conflicts
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : showConflicts(conflicts)
s-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : Move gym to Wednesday at 7am
w-&gt;&gt;&gt;c : onSend(message)
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;f : chat(message)
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;a : handle(message, workspace)
ref=a llm : SD4 loop - the LLM calls get_schedule, then move_task
a-&gt;&gt;&gt;mt : run(args, workspace)
combinedFragment=alt~a1 a ws
a:[blockId exists and newStart is a valid future time]
mt-&gt;&gt;&gt;pl : find(blockId)
pl.&gt;mt : block
mt-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : copy()
ws.&gt;mt : trial workspace
mt-&gt;&gt;&gt;mt + : apply a MoveBlockCommand to the trial
mt-&gt;&gt;&gt;cc : check(trial, forecast)
cc.&gt;mt : no conflicts
mt.&gt;a : ToolResult ok, Proposal with the MoveBlockCommand
..=a1
a:[unknown block or bad time - the tool does not run]
mt.&gt;a : ToolResult error, unknown block id
a-&gt;&gt;&gt;llm : complete(request with the error)
llm.&gt;a : final answer - Which gym session do you mean?
--=a1
a.&gt;f : AgentReply
f.&gt;c : reply
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : showProposal(proposal)
ref=s c : SD5 - apply, and undo if needed</panel_attributes>
